{"id":"4b683afd8e3e849b","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-model10-ultrapower-equivalence.md","title":"ZFC Model10 Ultrapower Equivalence","display":"df-zfc-model10-ultrapower-equivalence — ZFC Model10 Ultrapower Equivalence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model10-ultrapower-equivalence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model10-ultrapower-equivalence"],"display":"df-zfc-model10-ultrapower-equivalence — ZFC Model10 Ultrapower Equivalence","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model10-ultrapower-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model10-ultrapower-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model10-ultrapower-equivalence — ZFC Model10 Ultrapower Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,M\\in V\">\\(I,M\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^I\">\\(M^I\\)</span> is the function space defined here</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq M^I\\times M^I\">\\(E\\subseteq M^I\\times M^I\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10UltrapowerEquivalence}_S(E,U,I,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10UltrapowerEquivalence}_S(E,U,I,M)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}function\\text{-}space} \\vdash M^I\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(I\\times M):\\mathrm{Function}(f,I,M)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}function\\text{-}space} \\vdash M^I\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(I\\times M):\\mathrm{Function}(f,I,M)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10UltrapowerEquivalence}_S(E,U,I,M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land E\\subseteq M^I\\times M^I\\land\\forall f\\in M^I\\;\\forall g\\in M^I\\;\\bigl(\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow \\{i\\in I\\mid f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in U\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10UltrapowerEquivalence}_S(E,U,I,M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land E\\subseteq M^I\\times M^I\\land\\forall f\\in M^I\\;\\forall g\\in M^I\\;\\bigl(\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow \\{i\\in I\\mid f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in U\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The common codomain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is part of the signature, so <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> is exactly the usual <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>-almost-equality relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^I\">\\(M^I\\)</span>, rather than a relation on untyped functions with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"M^I","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq M^I\\times M^I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10UltrapowerEquivalence}_S(E,U,I,M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}function\\text{-}space} \\vdash M^I\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(I\\times M):\\mathrm{Function}(f,I,M)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10UltrapowerEquivalence}_S(E,U,I,M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land E\\subseteq M^I\\times M^I\\land\\forall f\\in M^I\\;\\forall g\\in M^I\\;\\bigl(\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow \\{i\\in I\\mid f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in U\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"M^I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false}],"bytes":1401,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2739","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-model10-ultrapower-equivalence.md|58-df-zfc-model10-ultrapower-equivalence]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","36d7463d215be751"]}